  <url type="vcs-browser">https://github.com/mitcad/Mitcad</url>
  <description>
    <p>This is a community package of MitCad, maintained independently and unaffiliated with its authors. It repackages the official upstream Linux build unmodified.</p>
    <p>MitCad is a parametric 3D CAD program. Sketches, features and parameters stay in one history, and it imports and exports STEP, IGES, STL, OBJ, DXF and other CAD files. A design is a .mitcad file.</p>
    <p>Sandbox: display, GPU, printing, and the Documents folder for a design passed by path. It works offline. Update checks are off; Flatpak delivers updates. Insert › Component from Web, and a manual update check, need network:</p>
    <p><code>flatpak override --user --share=network --env=MITCAD_NO_UPDATE_CHECK=0 io.github.mitcad.Mitcad</code></p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.mitcad.Mitcad.desktop</launchable>
